  "description": "Test helpers the suites share: temporary directories, polling waits, free ports, CLI output capture, an OpenAI-compatible stub, site fixture servers, a fake Discord, a prompt-prefix continuity check, fixture model, messaging and sandbox ports, a built plugin in a confined worker, the domains' recorded fixtures, and in-memory repositories. A development dependency of tests only",
